<title>POLAND: BPH leads Huta Sendzimira CP issue.</title>
<headline>BPH leads Huta Sendzimira CP issue.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Huta Sendzimira smelter chose Bank Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA to lead its four tranches of commercial papers of up to 25 million zlotys each, BPH said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said the 91-day paper would carry an interest based on the average yield of 13-week T-bills plus a margin. It gave no further details.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
